  (uuid_generate_v4(), '6mm-navajo-pearl-sterling-silver-beads-necklace-18-long', '4527698119', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4527698119/6mm-navajo-pearl-sterling-silver-beads?click_key=1cfeb984-505e-4dfb-bcde-81f75e423585%3ALTb9822b377bba8265653b6d139c5beb957f1f01c6&click_sum=c94598bc&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-23164-11-42&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&content_source=1cfeb984-505e-4dfb-bcde-81f75e423585%253ALTb9822b377bba8265653b6d139c5beb957f1f01c6',
   '6mm Navajo Pearl Sterling Silver Beads Necklace 18'''' Long', 'This is a high quality handmade necklace with Navajo Pearl silver beads. The round beads are 6mm size. Necklace measures 18" long with a lobster clasp. Necklace is handmade in USA and of Southwest origin. Thanks for looking and check out more items in my Etsy shop for more great items and deals! https://www.etsy.com/shop/925usa Payment: We accept all major credit cards through direct check out and Paypal. New Mexico residents have to pay sales tax. Payments must be made within 3 days of purchase or the purchase will be canceled. Shipping: SHIPPING IS FREE FOR ALL USA DOMESTIC SHIPMENTS! For international shipments, the shipping charge is $2.50 for each additional item. For USA domestic shipments, we use USPS First Class Mail with delivery confirmation and insurance is included. For international shipments, we use USPS First Class Mail. Expedited shipping is available upon request for an additional fee (please send us a message for rates). We take care in packaging all items carefully and ship within 1 business day. All Canada and Worldwide delivery time can exceed 20 days due to international custom clearance. Please send us a message if you have not received your item in a timely manner and we will be happy to assist you. Refunds and Exchanges: We are confident that the item will exceed your expectations, however if you are not completely satisfied for any reason, you may return the item within 14 days of receipt and we will gladly give you a full refund or exchange. Buyer is responsible for returned shipping costs.', 'statement-pieces',
