  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'handmade-german-silver-navajo-pearl-necklace', '4318090391', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4318090391/navajo-pearl-handmade-4-5-and-10mm?click_key=1cfeb984-505e-4dfb-bcde-81f75e423585%3ALT9ff1093b302278657e738feca29d0ef14087b6cb&click_sum=a08aac87&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-23164-11-41&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=1cfeb984-505e-4dfb-bcde-81f75e423585%253ALT9ff1093b302278657e738feca29d0ef14087b6cb',
   'Handmade German Silver Navajo Pearl Necklace', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Contact us! This beautiful Navajo Pearl necklace is made from 4, 5, and 10mm beads. CHOOSE YOUR LENGTH! Select your length from the drop-down menu. Choose from a stunning choker, to a traditional look, or an extra-long strand and wrap it around to create multiple looks! Finished with lobster clasp and links of chain for a customizable fit! DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John GERMAN SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them to create perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two desert pearls are exactly alike! See our About German Silver Page to learn more. GERMAN SILVER CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
