   'Handmade Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Necklace All 6mm ~ Choose Length ~ Classic Strand!', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Contact us! Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Necklace made from all 6mm beads. CHOOSE YOUR LENGTH! Select your length from the drop-down menu. Choose from a stunning choker, to a traditional look, or an extra-long strand and wrap it around to create multiple looks! Finished with lobster clasp and links of chain for a customizable fit! DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John STERLING SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS~ We hand make this jewelry line with beads of .925 Sterling Silver. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them to create perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two pearls are exactly alike! This high quality Sterling Silver is noted for its beauty, durability, and shine. STERLING SILVER CARE~ Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS~ We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with 60 day returns and repairs. *Restrictions may apply. See our Returns Page for more info. 50% OFF PRIORITY SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
