  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'turquoise-silver-necklace-bohemian-gemstone-jewelry', '4312900493', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4312900493/kingman-turquoise-silver-necklace?click_key=EugkcJZevM2EO6fM0v0nl1VJ0U96%3ALTea6dcc706609f7632d3c9b55edc8dc5c2b1bd4e7&click_sum=4815d95b&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-23163-11-12&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1',
   'Turquoise Silver Necklace: Bohemian Gemstone Jewelry', 'Turquoise Silver Necklace, Natural Turquoise Gemstone Handmade Bohemian Necklace Jewelry Gift for Wedding Please note : As this stone is natural, texture of every stone is different. so, the product you get in hands may slightly vary from the picture shown and not exact same as picture . And this is the beauty of each necklace being different than other. If any query, feel free and contact me. Crafted with the help of trained and experienced artisans team , our products are handmade with quality gemstones. I take care of perfect balance of combinations. We design each product taking care of style which will make you feel attractive . I also welcome to customize your choices. I try my best to serve my customers . **Thanks for Team Mohan Jewels** Production partners MohanJewels makes this item with help from Radhyshyam, West Bengal, India', 'turquoise-jewelry',
