  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'intricate-navajo-sterling-silver-foliate-necklace-with-spiderweb-turquoise-penda', '4443945904', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4443945904/intricate-navajo-sterling-silver-foliate?click_key=EugkcJZevM2EO6fM0v0nl1VJ0U96%3ALT130f27db82b3223d5245df6b4f846deccfd88244&click_sum=ebf6a094&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-23163-11-11&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1',
   'Intricate Navajo Sterling Silver Foliate Necklace with Spiderweb Turquoise Pendant & matching earrings, by Nalwood', 'I am a longtime admirer of Navajo silver artist Clem Nalwood, and this necklace and earrings set is a perfect example of his work. His unique and modern take on Navajo foliate design is lush and layered, and each individual petal is a work of art. The silver swag is so densely decorated that it reminds me of a textile -- it literally looks woven of metal. It is rare to find vintage jewelry this unique and beautiful. The spiderweb turquoise is impeccable, and every detail of the silver is perfect. The necklace tests as sterling silver and is signed by the artist. It''s definitely a statement piece -- very special. The earrings are a perfect match.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
