  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'authentic-handcrafted-navajo-three-stone-green-turquoise-sterling-silver-cuff-br', '4604211686', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4604211686/authentic-handcrafted-navajo-three-stone?click_key=EugkcJZevM2EO6fM0v0nl1VJ0U96%3ALT2c74eacf8eddb41ca5b30babc2cf6c33c8d6ff4d&click_sum=3d3c3e86&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-23163-11-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1',
   'Authentic Handcrafted Navajo Three-Stone Green Turquoise & Sterling Silver Cuff Bracelet with Stamped Sunburst Detail', 'Navajo Three-Stone Green Turquoise & Sterling Silver Cuff Bracelet with Stamped Sunburst Detail Three luminous green turquoise cabochons bring striking color to this handcrafted sterling silver cuff. The larger center stone is flanked by two smaller ovals, each framed with twisted silver wire and a decorative halo of silver beads. Flecks of matrix lend individuality to the stones and complement the bracelet’s warm, aged patina. Open silver rails and arrow-like accents connect the settings, creating a graceful, airy look across the front. Along the sides, stamped sunburst and floral motifs, geometric designs, and fine linear details continue toward the rounded terminals. Oxidation in the recessed silverwork brings depth to the design and highlights its intricate decoration. Distinctive and easy to wear, this cuff makes a beautiful statement on its own while celebrating the rich visual character of Southwestern jewelry. Much of our jewelry is sourced from private collections, many of distinguished provenance. We believe these exceptional pieces—and the investment you make in them—deserve thoughtful care. For that reason, we do not offer a blanket return policy or accept returns for temporary wear or a change of mind. This helps us preserve the condition and integrity of each piece for its next owner. We stand behind the accuracy of our descriptions. If a piece you purchase has been misrepresented, please contact us within seven days of receiving it. Once the piece is returned in the same condition in which it left our care, we will make it right by providing a refund or arranging a mutually agreed-upon replacement. Our commitment is to offer jewelry you can purchase with confidence and treasure with pride. Details - Materials: Sterling silver and turquoise - Weight: 38 grams - Design: Three oval cabochons, silver bead accents, open rails and stamped detailing - Artist: Not identified - Measurements: Interior circumference 5.25", opening 1" About The Canyon Turquoise C', 'turquoise-jewelry',
