  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'big-84-4-grams-navajo-cuff-by-n-d-bonomo-rare-broken-arrow-mine-variscite-sterli', '4582057343', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4582057343/big-844-grams-navajo-cuff-by-n-d-bonomo?click_key=EugkcJZevM2EO6fM0v0nl1VJ0U96%3ALT26c28b014ddffd1958dcf4313911a527d4ccd30d&click_sum=fa8cb1f0&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-784233-11-2&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1',
   'Big (84.4 grams) Navajo Cuff by N. D. Bonomo Rare Broken Arrow Mine Variscite! & Sterling Silver 6 3/4 inch fit with gap 2" tall', 'Big Navajo Broken Arrow Mine Variscite and Sterling Silver Cuff bracelet by N. D. Bonomo. Bracelet highlights large glossy green variscite with black and gold highlights framed by Navajo silverwork design. Bracelet measures 2 inches in width a widest. It has an inside measurement of 5 3/4 interior measurement inches plus a gap of 1 inches =6 3/4inches total wearable circumference. In excellent condition (see pics). Great gift or addition to any jewelry collection. (weighs 84.4 grams). Hallmarked N D Bonomo (Navajo silversmith) on back. Highly prized gemstone -The Broken Arrow Claim is near the Royston claims in Nevada. This variscite is known for is glassy emerald green color. Its often translucent and takes a high polish. Comes in jewelry gift box-Free domestic shipping! Refunds and Exchanges We do accept returns within 30 days of the purchase of the item. However, the buyer is responsible for shipping the item back to us and that cost will not be refunded. We will refund your money for the item as soon as we receive the item back. Please send the item back to us with tracking. MSD', 'turquoise-jewelry',
